- defines(v2, "do you want to try again", {}), defines(v4, "do you want to try again after second failure", {}), defines(v5, "is the login successful after third try", {}): Declare empty value ranges that fail to reflect the binary outcomes (e.g., yes/no or try/abort) implied by the source text.
